       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45c30a3354c38331cc42d11962474554?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FJW-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Jared Whiklo",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "attrs": {
         "localId": "4d64aa5c5ece"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I’m just noting that the documentation for this says",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "localId": "c2fb1656cdb3"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "localId": "6dd86b9ea6a0"
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "text": "DelegateHeaderPrincipalProvider is a Principal Provider that uses the ",
            "type": "text"
           },
           {
            "marks": [
             {
              "type": "code"
             }
            ],
            "text": "On-Behalf-Of",
            "type": "text"
           },
           {
            "text": " HTTP header to switch the user principal to the principal given in the header. This switch is only performed if the authenticated user has the fedoraAdmin container role.",
            "type": "text"
           }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
         }
        ],
        "type": "blockquote"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "localId": "1eae4a0738fd"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "But it is not clear to me, how the roles are verified on a user not authenticated in the same container. It will need some research as I can’t remember what it’s design principals were or how it works.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
     "created": "2026-09-17T12:54:39.348-0300",
