  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>When a username is sent in the On-Behalf-Of header to Fedora, it will be used in WebAC authentication. We believe that it should also be used to update the <b>fedora: createdBy</b> and <b>fedora: lastModifiedBy</b> triples (the UpstreamAuth feature in Fedora 3.3+ did this too). This enables applications which implement their own authn/authz and are talking to Fedora via admin account to transparently act on behalf of the upstream user, which is important for audit purposes.</p>",
